<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Ghid Creare Site Client</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  :root {
    --gold: #C9A84C;
    --gold-light: #E8D5A3;
    --black: #0D0D0D;
    --dark: #1A1A1A;
    --dark2: #242424;
    --white: #FFFFFF;
    --gray: #888888;
  }

  body {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    background: var(--black);
    color: var(--white);
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* HEADER */
  .header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.2);
  }

  .header-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.4);
    padding: 0.4rem 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .header h1 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .header h1 span { color: var(--gold); }

  .header p {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  /* STEPS */
  .steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }

  .step {
    background: var(--dark);
    border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.1);
    padding: 2rem;
    position: relative;
    transition: border-color 0.3s;
  }

  .step:hover { border-color: rgba(201,168,76,0.35); }

  .step-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }

  .step-number {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border: 1px solid var(--gold);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .step-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .step-emoji {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .step-items {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding-left: 0.5rem;
  }

  .step-items li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .step-items li::before {
    content: '';
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gold);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.55rem;
  }

  .step-items li strong {
    color: var(--white);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .step-note {
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    background: rgba(201,168,76,0.06);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--gold);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* CONNECTOR */
  .connector {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    color: rgba(201,168,76,0.3);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin: -0.5rem 0;
  }

  /* OPTIONAL BADGE */
  .optional-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    background: rgba(201,168,76,0.1);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    margin-left: 0.8rem;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  /* FOOTER */
  .footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 4rem;
    padding-top: 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.2);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .footer span { color: var(--gold); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

  <div class="header">
    <div class="header-badge">Workless Systems</div>
    <h1>Ghid Creare<br/><span>Site Client</span></h1>
    <p>Claude + GitHub — flux complet pas cu pas</p>
  </div>

  <div class="steps">

    <!-- PASUL 1 -->
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-header">
        <div class="step-number">1</div>
        <div class="step-title">Informații client</div>
        <div class="step-emoji">📋</div>
      </div>
      <ul class="step-items">
        <li>Numele afacerii</li>
        <li>Tipul site-ului — <strong>restaurant, firmă, portofoliu, magazin</strong></li>
        <li>Culori preferate și stil vizual</li>
        <li>Structură — <strong>one-page</strong> sau mai multe pagini</li>
        <li>Detalii conținut — adresă, telefon, meniu, servicii etc.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="step-note">💡 Poți folosi detalii fictive dacă clientul nu le are pregătite</div>
    </div>

    <div class="connector">↓</div>

    <!-- PASUL 2 -->
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-header">
        <div class="step-number">2</div>
        <div class="step-title">Generare cod cu Claude</div>
        <div class="step-emoji">🤖</div>
      </div>
      <ul class="step-items">
        <li>Dai toate informațiile lui <strong>Claude</strong></li>
        <li>Claude generează fișierul <strong>index.html</strong> complet</li>
        <li>Descarci fișierul pe calculator</li>
        <li>Îl deschizi în Chrome să verifici cum arată</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="step-note">💡 Dacă vrei modificări — spui lui Claude ce să schimbe și descarci din nou</div>
    </div>

    <div class="connector">↓</div>

    <!-- PASUL 3 -->
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-header">
        <div class="step-number">3</div>
        <div class="step-title">Creare repository GitHub</div>
        <div class="step-emoji">📁</div>
      </div>
      <ul class="step-items">
        <li>Mergi pe <strong>github.com</strong> → butonul <strong>"+"</strong> → New repository</li>
        <li>Numele repository-ului — ex: <strong>"gafino"</strong></li>
        <li>Setezi ca <strong>Public</strong></li>
        <li>Dai <strong>Create repository</strong></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="connector">↓</div>

    <!-- PASUL 4 -->
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-header">
        <div class="step-number">4</div>
        <div class="step-title">Upload fișier pe GitHub</div>
        <div class="step-emoji">⬆️</div>
      </div>
      <ul class="step-items">
        <li>În repository dai click pe <strong>"Add file"</strong> → <strong>"Upload files"</strong></li>
        <li>Tragi fișierul <strong>index.html</strong> acolo</li>
        <li>Jos dai <strong>"Commit changes"</strong></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="connector">↓</div>

    <!-- PASUL 5 -->
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-header">
        <div class="step-number">5</div>
        <div class="step-title">Activare GitHub Pages</div>
        <div class="step-emoji">🌐</div>
      </div>
      <ul class="step-items">
        <li>Mergi la <strong>Settings</strong> → <strong>Pages</strong></li>
        <li>La Branch selectezi <strong>main</strong> → Save</li>
        <li>Aștepți 1-2 minute</li>
        <li>Copiezi linkul live: <strong>username.github.io/nume-repo</strong></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="step-note">💡 Linkul se actualizează automat la fiecare upload nou</div>
    </div>

    <div class="connector">↓</div>

    <!-- PASUL 6 -->
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-header">
        <div class="step-number">6</div>
        <div class="step-title">Trimite clientului pentru aprobare</div>
        <div class="step-emoji">📤</div>
      </div>
      <ul class="step-items">
        <li>Trimiți linkul live pe <strong>WhatsApp / email</strong></li>
        <li>Clientul vede site-ul direct în browser</li>
        <li>Dacă vrea modificări → spui lui Claude → upload din nou → linkul se actualizează</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="connector">↓</div>

    <!-- PASUL 7 - OPTIONAL -->
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-header">
        <div class="step-number">7</div>
        <div class="step-title">
          Domeniu propriu
          <span class="optional-badge">Opțional</span>
        </div>
        <div class="step-emoji">🔗</div>
      </div>
      <ul class="step-items">
        <li>Clientul cumpără domeniu — ex: <strong>gafino.ro</strong></li>
        <li>Tu adaugi DNS-urile în <strong>Hostinger / Cloudflare</strong></li>
        <li>În GitHub Pages adaugi domeniul la <strong>Custom domain</strong></li>
        <li>Înregistrezi domeniul în <strong>Google Search Console</strong></li>
        <li>Site-ul apare la <strong>www.gafino.ro</strong></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="step-note">💡 Fără domeniu propriu, site-ul e live la linkul GitHub Pages — perfect pentru previzualizare</div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    Creat de <span>Workless Systems</span> · Claude + GitHub Workflow
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
